      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That would be a great feature and benefit. It would be even more immersive for desktop players to be able to move around more naturally.\n\nThe build in Selfie Expression is already a good feature but lacks in some movements (arms and hands can't get backward, no real body movement, gestures for e.g. grabbing aren't working).\n\nIt would make VRChat even nicer!",
